<header class="page-intro">
  <h1>Security desk</h1>
  <p class="lede">Release items, decide claims, and close lost reports. Officers at the Administration Block and the other security points use this desk. <%= plural(pendingCount, 'claim') %> <%= pendingCount === 1 ? 'is' : 'are' %> waiting.</p>
</header>

<section class="panel gate">
  <h2>Open the desk</h2>
  <p>For this community demo the desk code is stored in the register and shown here so you can try the officer side.</p>
  <p class="code-hint">Desk code <strong><%= deskCode %></strong></p>
  <form method="post" action="/desk/unlock" class="unlock">
    <label for="code">Enter the desk code</label>
    <input id="code" name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" maxlength="8" required>
    <button class="button gold" type="submit">Open desk</button>
  </form>
</section>
